			</a>
			<a href="/alternatives/mailcow/" class="feature-card alt-index-card">
				<h3>Vectis Mail vs Mailcow &rarr;</h3>
				<p>Declarative config and a transactional sending API vs Mailcow's web-UI-driven, admin-only surface.</p>
			</a>
			<a href="/guides/best-self-hosted-email-servers-2026/" class="feature-card alt-index-card">
				<h3>Best self-hosted email servers (2026) &rarr;</h3>
				<p>The whole landscape by buyer type — seven options including both of these, compared side by side.</p>
			</a>
		</div>
	</section>

